1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,472
Hey everyone, welcome back to the Car
Detailing Podcast.

2
00:00:03,822 --> 00:00:04,806
I'm Sam.

3
00:00:05,156 --> 00:00:05,996
And I'm Alex.

4
00:00:06,346 --> 00:00:08,746
Coming to you from Desert Diamond in
Dubai.

5
00:00:09,095 --> 00:00:12,143
Today we're talking about something no
driver wants to deal with.

6
00:00:12,493 --> 00:00:13,813
A cracked windshield.

7
00:00:14,163 --> 00:00:16,443
Specifically, windshield replacement.

8
00:00:16,793 --> 00:00:20,129
And we have a guest who just had it done
at our Al Quoz studio.

9
00:00:20,479 --> 00:00:21,487
Please welcome Lena.

10
00:00:21,837 --> 00:00:26,181
Hi Alex, hi Sam. Thanks for having me.

11
00:00:26,531 --> 00:00:29,627
Lena, you and Markus are from Germany,
right?

12
00:00:29,977 --> 00:00:33,961
Berlin. We moved here six months ago.

13
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:35,390
Welcome to Dubai.

14
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:40,588
Danke. We love it. The driving, though...

15
00:00:40,938 --> 00:00:41,826
What happened?

16
00:00:42,176 --> 00:00:46,976
We were on Sheikh Zayed Road. A truck
kicked up a stone.

17
00:00:47,326 --> 00:00:47,974
Oh no.

18
00:00:48,324 --> 00:00:52,812
Ping. A crack right across the driver's
line of sight.

19
00:00:53,162 --> 00:00:55,010
That's the worst possible spot.

20
00:00:55,360 --> 00:01:00,640
Exactly. We had an anniversary photoshoot
planned for Saturday.

21
00:01:00,989 --> 00:01:01,589
Nice.

22
00:01:01,939 --> 00:01:05,419
And a road trip to Abu Dhabi the next day.

23
00:01:05,769 --> 00:01:07,641
So you couldn't drive with that crack.

24
00:01:07,991 --> 00:01:13,535
No way. I didn't want it spreading, and I
didn't want it in the photos.

25
00:01:13,885 --> 00:01:14,797
Totally fair.

26
00:01:15,147 --> 00:01:21,003
So I went online, car-care.center, and
booked the windshield replacement.

27
00:01:21,353 --> 00:01:22,265
That easy?

28
00:01:22,615 --> 00:01:29,023
Took maybe two minutes. Picked Al Quoz
Industrial Area 3, chose a slot.

29
00:01:29,372 --> 00:01:30,356
No phone tag?

30
00:01:30,706 --> 00:01:35,050
I got a reminder call the day before. That
was it.

31
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,192
Smooth.

32
00:01:36,542 --> 00:01:41,654
When we arrived, the studio looked very
clean. Professional.

33
00:01:42,004 --> 00:01:43,252
On 22nd Street.

34
00:01:43,602 --> 00:01:50,010
Yes. Bright, organized. Not at all like a
grimy garage.

35
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:56,216
There was signage, a clean reception desk.
Someone offered us water.

36
00:01:56,566 --> 00:01:57,598
Nice touch.

37
00:01:57,947 --> 00:01:59,555
Did they take your keys right away?

38
00:01:59,905 --> 00:02:06,505
Yes. They did a walk-around first, noted
existing scratches, things like that.

39
00:02:06,855 --> 00:02:09,711
So they were careful not to blame you for
anything later.

40
00:02:10,061 --> 00:02:12,797
Exactly. Very thorough.

41
00:02:13,147 --> 00:02:14,203
Then into the bay.

42
00:02:14,553 --> 00:02:16,185
Did they explain the process?

43
00:02:16,535 --> 00:02:22,319
Yes. A specialist did a walk-around with
us, showed us the damage.

44
00:02:22,669 --> 00:02:23,197
And?

45
00:02:23,546 --> 00:02:28,850
They explained they'd remove the old glass
and install a new one, seal it properly.

46
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:30,136
No jargon?

47
00:02:30,486 --> 00:02:34,158
None. Just clear, straight talk.

48
00:02:34,508 --> 00:02:37,052
Did they show you the new glass before
putting it in?

49
00:02:37,402 --> 00:02:43,066
Yes. They brought it over, showed us it
was the right fit for the Mercedes.

50
00:02:43,416 --> 00:02:45,648
European-trained specialists, right?

51
00:02:45,998 --> 00:02:49,358
That's what they told us. It showed.

52
00:02:49,708 --> 00:02:51,556
So you dropped the car and waited?

53
00:02:51,905 --> 00:02:58,313
We waited in the lounge. Had coffee. They
took the Mercedes into the bay.

54
00:02:58,663 --> 00:02:59,839
Could you see them working?

55
00:03:00,189 --> 00:03:06,597
Not really. They had the bay sectioned
off. But we could hear them being careful.

56
00:03:06,947 --> 00:03:08,147
That's reassuring.

57
00:03:08,497 --> 00:03:09,529
How long were you there?

58
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:14,919
I honestly didn't time it. They said
they'd come get us when it was ready.

59
00:03:15,269 --> 00:03:16,565
Not an all-day thing?

60
00:03:16,915 --> 00:03:19,963
No. It was straightforward.

61
00:03:20,312 --> 00:03:23,912
When they called us, they walked us
through what they'd done.

62
00:03:24,262 --> 00:03:27,814
When they brought the car out, the crack
was just gone.

63
00:03:28,164 --> 00:03:28,956
No trace?

64
00:03:29,306 --> 00:03:36,530
None. The glass looked flawless. No
distortion, no strange reflections.

65
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,056
Did they clean up too?

66
00:03:38,406 --> 00:03:43,254
They wiped everything down. The interior
even felt fresher.

67
00:03:43,604 --> 00:03:45,452
Did it sound different on the highway?

68
00:03:45,802 --> 00:03:52,282
No whistling. No air leaks. Just solid,
quiet glass.

69
00:03:52,631 --> 00:03:53,495
That's huge.

70
00:03:53,845 --> 00:03:58,141
Markus tapped it and smiled. He was
impressed.

71
00:03:58,491 --> 00:04:00,147
The German seal of approval.

72
00:04:00,497 --> 00:04:01,553
Literally.

73
00:04:01,903 --> 00:04:03,175
Attention to detail.

74
00:04:03,525 --> 00:04:09,861
Exactly. It wasn't just about the glass.
They cared about the whole car.

75
00:04:10,211 --> 00:04:15,947
Driving away, I looked over at Markus. He
looked relieved too.

76
00:04:16,297 --> 00:04:18,001
That peace of mind is worth a lot.

77
00:04:18,350 --> 00:04:19,790
So you did the photoshoot?

78
00:04:20,140 --> 00:04:26,980
We did. The Mercedes looked sharp. The
windshield was perfect in every shot.

79
00:04:27,330 --> 00:04:28,842
And the drive to Abu Dhabi?

80
00:04:29,192 --> 00:04:35,528
Zero stress. No crack distracting me. Just
clear visibility.

81
00:04:35,878 --> 00:04:36,598
Worth it?

82
00:04:36,948 --> 00:04:44,532
Absolutely. Driving away, I felt safe. It
just felt right to have it fixed properly.

83
00:04:44,882 --> 00:04:47,186
You can tell when a place takes pride in
their work.

84
00:04:47,536 --> 00:04:54,136
That's it. In Germany we're strict about
windshields. TÜV and all that.

85
00:04:54,485 --> 00:04:55,613
I respect that.

86
00:04:55,963 --> 00:04:58,603
Sam, what would you do if you had a crack
like that?

87
00:04:58,953 --> 00:05:04,497
Replace it. No question. The windshield is
part of the car's safety structure.

88
00:05:04,847 --> 00:05:07,223
Exactly. It's not just cosmetic.

89
00:05:07,573 --> 00:05:08,749
Exactly.

90
00:05:09,099 --> 00:05:14,235
By the way, the service page lists Car
Windshield Replacement at 500 AED.

91
00:05:14,585 --> 00:05:15,593
Is that right?

92
00:05:15,943 --> 00:05:21,055
I saw that when I booked. Seemed fair for
the peace of mind.

93
00:05:21,404 --> 00:05:24,092
Though the exact price depends on the car
and the glass.

94
00:05:24,442 --> 00:05:26,746
They were transparent about that.

95
00:05:27,096 --> 00:05:28,008
Good to know.

96
00:05:28,358 --> 00:05:31,526
Time for our expert segment. Omar, you're
up.

97
00:05:31,876 --> 00:05:34,300
Hey everyone. Omar here.

98
00:05:34,650 --> 00:05:39,474
Omar, how do I protect my paint and
interior from this Dubai sun and heat?

99
00:05:39,824 --> 00:05:45,704
The sun here is brutal. For the paint,
ceramic coating and PPF help shield the

100
00:05:46,054 --> 00:05:47,110
And for the inside?

101
00:05:47,459 --> 00:05:53,771
Window tinting cuts down heat and UV.
Regular interior cleaning keeps surfaces

102
00:05:54,121 --> 00:05:55,129
So layer them?

103
00:05:55,479 --> 00:05:58,551
Exactly. Combine what your car needs.

104
00:05:58,901 --> 00:05:59,621
Great tip.

105
00:05:59,971 --> 00:06:01,627
Now, service duel.

106
00:06:01,977 --> 00:06:06,345
Windshield replacement — best fit for a
long road trip, or just a tiny chip?

107
00:06:06,695 --> 00:06:08,615
Road trip, hands down.

108
00:06:08,965 --> 00:06:09,493
Why?

109
00:06:09,842 --> 00:06:13,346
You don't want a crack spreading at 120
kilometers an hour.

110
00:06:13,696 --> 00:06:16,840
True. But a small chip that's not in your
line of sight?

111
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:21,966
Then maybe a repair is enough. Replacement
is for when it's really compromised.

112
00:06:22,316 --> 00:06:26,276
So today's service is the heavy hitter for
serious damage before a big drive.

113
00:06:26,626 --> 00:06:27,562
Exactly.

114
00:06:27,912 --> 00:06:30,432
Lena, any final thoughts for our
listeners?

115
00:06:30,782 --> 00:06:35,750
If your windshield is cracked, don't wait.
Get it checked.

116
00:06:36,100 --> 00:06:37,156
Wise words.

117
00:06:37,505 --> 00:06:39,137
Thanks for joining us, Lena.

118
00:06:39,487 --> 00:06:41,959
Danke. Goodbye.

119
00:06:42,309 --> 00:06:48,141
Before we go — if you need windshield
replacement or any detailing, visit

120
00:06:48,491 --> 00:06:51,179
Dubai and Abu Dhabi. Book online.

121
00:06:51,529 --> 00:06:55,417
Al Quoz Industrial Area 3, or our Abu
Dhabi studio.

122
00:06:55,767 --> 00:06:58,191
Until next time, keep your car looking
sharp.

123
00:06:58,541 --> 00:06:59,573
Drive safe.
